+### `companionReplies`
+
+Set `"companionReplies": true` to enable the [public reply API](./companion-replies.md).
+Only the boolean `true` opts in; missing, false, strings and other values remain off.
+Read once at tool registration, so restart/reload Pi after changing it. The package
+never writes this file. This authorizes full question/description/preview disclosure
+to trusted local event-bus subscribers and permits their replies. No transport or
+authentication is provided. RPC, unknown-mode and unrendered custom hosts never
+publish these sensitive events, even with the setting enabled.
+
